<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-nuptus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		2. in-nubo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>unmarried.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pueri innuptaeque puellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 476</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Minerva,</span>”
				<i>virginal</i>, <i>virgin-</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					2, 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				<i>the Amazons</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil. 2,
					75</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">innupta</span></b> , ae, f., <i>an unmarried woman</i>, <i>a virgin</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 62,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">36</span></i>; 64, 78; <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
				19, 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 12, 24</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praegnans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. in Luc. 2, 2</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: innuptae nuptiae (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμος ἄγαμος</span>), <i>a
				marriage that is no marriage, an unhappy marriage</i>,
			Poëta ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 3, 58, 219</span></i> (Trag.
			Fragm. Inc. v. 80 Rib.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
